 "intro_zh": "颍上八里河景区主园区包含“世界风光”“锦绣中华”“碧波游览区”“鸟语林”等景点碧波万顷，风光旖旎。八里河景区融中西建筑于一体，尽现建筑文化和园林文化的魅力。",
 "intro_en": "Fuyang (simplified Chinese: 阜阳; traditional Chinese: 阜陽; pinyin: , previously romanized as Fowyang) is a prefecture-level city in northwestern Anhui province, China. It is bordered by Henan province to the west and the cities of Bozhou to the northeast, Huainan to the southeast, and Lu'an to the south. Its population was 8,200,264 inhabitants at the 2020 census whom 2,128,538 lived in the built-up (or metro) area made of 3 urban districts Yingzhou, Yingdong and Yingquan.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
